# Optional CSV overlay for FNV symbols xNVSE doesn't expose.
#
# Copy or rename this file to `fnv_names.csv` to enable.  The address
# scanner reads it after the xNVSE header scan; later rows override
# earlier ones (CSV overlay takes precedence over xNVSE for the same
# RVA).
#
# Columns:
#   name   Symbol name as it should appear in Ghidra.
#   rva    RVA into FalloutNV.exe (i.e., VA minus the 0x00400000 image
#          base for the standard FNV 1.4.0.525 build).  Hex or decimal.
#   kind   Either "func" or "label".  Use "func" if you want Ghidra to
#          materialize a function at this address; "label" places only a
#          symbol.
#   class  Optional containing class (used to produce ClassName::Method).
#
# Comment lines start with '#'.  Blank lines are skipped.
#
# Examples:
# name,rva,kind,class
# PlayerCharacter_GetSingleton,0x471B40,func,
# TESForm_LookupByID,0x83A00,func,TESForm
